5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hello everyone! I'm so excited to play with you all! Let's work together and find the werewolf, okay? I'll do my very best to help the village! Good luck to us!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I'll do my best too... I hope we can find them without anyone getting hurt.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Let's keep our emotions in check and focus on the logic. We need to observe everyone's behavior carefully to identify any contradictions. I'll be watching closely.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let us be kind to one another as we search for the truth. I believe that if we stay calm, we can protect our village together.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. It's nice to meet you all. I agree with Shizue; let's try to keep things peaceful and supportive while we figure this out. I'll do my best to help everyone!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with Asuka! Logic is important, but let's not forget to support each other too! Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they want to share before the first night?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't really have a strategy. I'm not very good at this... I'll just listen to what you all think and try to help however I can.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have no information yet, the most efficient approach is to analyze the voting patterns and the Seer's claims starting tomorrow. For now, we should simply observe who is trying too hard to blend in.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a very sensible plan, Asuka. While we observe, let us remember to be patient with one another. Poor Daisuke seems a bit nervous; let's make sure he feels welcome in our discussion.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Thank you, Shizue. You're right, let's be gentle with Daisuke. I think Asuka's plan to observe is a good start. I'm a bit nervous too, but I'll do my best to stay attentive!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Daisuke"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"You're so sweet, Shizue and Midori! I'm sure Daisuke will be great! Since we're all on the same page about observing, I'll just keep a positive vibe going! I'm ready for the first night!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Midori"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you... for being so kind to me. I'll try my best to be useful... I'm ready too.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I have nothing further to add for now. Let us proceed to the first night and see what information emerges. I will be analyzing the discourse from tomorrow onwards.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"I agree. Let us all have a peaceful night's rest. I shall be praying for everyone's safety and for the Seer to find a helpful clue for us. Sleep well, dear everyone.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree. Let's all get some rest and hope for a safe night. I'll be thinking of everyone. Goodnight, and I look forward to talking with you all again tomorrow!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Goodnight everyone! Sleep tight and sweet dreams! I'll be cheering for all of us from my dreams! See you all tomorrow morning! Let's do our best!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Goodnight... I hope everyone is okay tomorrow. See you all then.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Over"",""raw"":""Over.""}],""raw"":""Over.""}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Goodnight, my dear friends. May your dreams be sweet and your hearts be light. I shall see you all in the morning.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Goodnight, everyone. I'll be hoping for a peaceful morning. See you all tomorrow!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
