33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well! I have some really important news... I'm the Seer, and I checked Asuka last night. It turns out Asuka is the werewolf! This is scary, but we can do this!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,@Yumi... really? Asuka is the werewolf? I... I can't believe it. Are you sure? I don't want to make a mistake and vote for the wrong person...,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, that is a bold claim to make so early. There is no evidence other than your word. Are you truly the Seer, or are you the Werewolf attempting to frame me immediately?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Yumi, thank you for sharing your findings so bravely. @Asuka, please try to stay calm. It is a very shocking start to our morning, and I can see why you both feel this way.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, thank you for telling us so quickly. It's a very surprising start! @Asuka, I understand why you're skeptical, but let's try to listen to each other calmly so we can figure out the truth together.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I promise I'm telling the truth! I'm not trying to frame you, I just want to protect everyone! @Daisuke, please trust me! I'm doing my best to help us win this together!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi... I want to trust you, but it's just so sudden. @Asuka is usually so logical... I'm really torn. I don't want to be the reason an innocent person gets hurt... what should I do?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, your hesitation is logical. @Yumi's immediate accusation is a classic tactic to force a quick execution before any real analysis can occur. If she is the Werewolf or Possessed, she is using a fake Seer claim to eliminate me.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, your perspective is also very clear. @Yumi, your eagerness to help is wonderful, but perhaps we should all take a deep breath. It is a difficult choice when two people speak with such conviction.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, @Asuka, please try not to argue too harshly. It's hard for us to know who to believe right now. @Daisuke, it's okay to be unsure; we're all in this together. Let's think carefully about our next move.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I'm not using a tactic, I'm just telling you what I saw! @Daisuke, please, I really am the Seer! If we don't vote for Asuka now, the werewolf will just keep attacking us! I believe in us!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi... I... I want to believe you. But @Asuka's words make me worry. If I vote and I'm wrong... I don't know if I can handle that. I'm so sorry, I'm just... really confused.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, your desperation is becoming evident. A real Seer would provide a more measured analysis rather than relying on emotional appeals. @Daisuke, do not let her pressure you into a hasty decision that could cost us a human life.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Yumi, @Asuka, please, let us not let our words become sharp. @Daisuke, it is alright to be confused; your kindness is a virtue. Let us all think quietly for a moment before we decide.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, @Asuka, please, let's try to find a middle ground. @Daisuke, your feelings are completely natural. Since we only have one day to decide, we must be careful. Does anyone else have any thoughts on this situation?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I'm not being desperate, I'm being honest! I really want us all to be safe! @Daisuke, Shizue, Midori, please trust me! Let's be brave and vote for Asuka so we can win this!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke"",""Shizue"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi... I... I'll try to trust you. I don't want anyone else to be in danger. I'm still scared, but if you're sure... I'll do what I think is best for everyone.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, your insistence on a rush vote is a clear sign of a fake claim. If you are executed today, the village will realize their mistake. I urge everyone to consider the risk of losing a human.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Yumi, @Asuka, thank you both for speaking your hearts. It is a heavy burden to decide. I shall cast my vote with a prayer that we are doing what is right for our village.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, @Asuka, thank you for your honesty. It's a very difficult choice, but we have to make a decision for the village. I'll cast my vote carefully, hoping we find the truth. Good luck to everyone.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
